direction: down

L0: cudaMalloc / cudaFree\n每次都走 CUDA {
    style.stroke: red
}
L1: Caching Allocator\nblock cache + reuse {
    style.stroke: orange
}
L2: Lifetime-aware Pools\nWeight 与 Runtime 分离 {
    style.stroke: blue
}
L3: Tensor-level Reuse\n利用 size repetition {
    style.stroke: green
}
L4: Model-level Layout Reuse\nownership transfer {
    style.stroke: green
    style.bold: true
}
L5: Memory Planner\ncompile/runtime co-design {
    style.stroke: blue
    style.bold: true
    style.stroke-width: 3
}

L0 -> L1
L1 -> L2
L2 -> L3
L3 -> L4
L4 -> L5
